// EXPECT-ERROR: foreign type cannot be marked sendable
// A `type foreign` layout is C's: it cannot claim cross-thread shareability in
// any form. Foreign composites live inside `type unsafe sendable` trusted
// interiors or thread-local state (unsafe_sendable_foreign_field_ok;
// concurrency-design.md §派生规则 9).

type foreign sendable FX(a: Int32);
